{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "02KN", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0002": "$X \\to Y$", "MATH_0003": "$X' \\to Y'$", "MATH_0004": "$X \\to Y$", "MATH_0005": "$\\tau$", "MATH_0006": "$\\tau$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:5f45c720fd6cfd86d598936488760e40cf997cf96795b91da8ee5633b5ecb810", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5752f0d1942fa0e59487116dedd8c439afe87bb89903a1d35de844511dd58c78", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nTo be sure, since isomorphisms are always coverings\nwe see (or require) that property <MATH_0001> holds for <MATH_0002>\nif and only if it holds for any arrow <MATH_0003> isomorphic to <MATH_0004>.\nIf a property is <MATH_0005>-local on the target then it is preserved\nby base changes by morphisms which occur in <MATH_0006>-coverings. Here\nis a formal statement.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3ea4c965efeed492e171decb2f2a1106004c3c93b29ff8806699354e984652ac", "unit_id": "tag:02KN:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02KN", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$\\tau \\in \\{fpqc, fppf, syntomic, smooth, \\etale, Zariski\\}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\tau$", "MATH_0004": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0006": "$Y' \\to Y$", "MATH_0007": "$f' : Y' \\times_Y X \\to Y'$", "MATH_0008": "$f$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "SPACE_0001": "\\ ", "SPACE_0002": "\\ ", "SPACE_0003": "\\ ", "SPACE_0004": "\\ "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-pullback-property-local-target}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b7546e127fe910e8043838c43a1f9cc38f0ef0caa1bc5533c808e2ff04a93e36", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9c4419d7c56a38edf74bc4408a475a6513d41579409e7d76586d87b0f859367e", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a property of morphisms which is <MATH_0003> local\non the target. Let <MATH_0004> have property <MATH_0005>.\nFor any morphism <MATH_0006> which is\nflat, resp.<SPACE_0001>flat and locally of finite presentation, resp.<SPACE_0002>syntomic,\nresp.<SPACE_0003><ACCENT_0001>tale, resp.<SPACE_0004>an open immersion, the base change\n<MATH_0007> of <MATH_0008> has property <MATH_0009>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d25d5b4e623c5ade97bbb5bf2563d0f3081966a1b6d2a1e8ad0389b222739d65", "unit_id": "tag:04QU:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02KN", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$Y' \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$\\tau$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:153d6d76483568620c0dd822a3843928ea00af2770c657c1c6a177a9ed621a64", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a83a18e4ef98055b80735baa5f22a2d1785b63adf15999e9fc2cb07560c0f24f", "source_text": "This is true because we can fit <MATH_0001> into a family of\nmorphisms which forms a <MATH_0002>-covering.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f136925c8bd7c0c110b6c290e7c3b5b880cf5cecf24fe559a694f7702cf47e6d", "unit_id": "tag:04QU:proof"}
